{"id":251238,"name":"Golf 2 Apt, 1BDR","headline":"Comfy & Cozy 1BDR @ Heart of Heliopolis","summary":"Discover your modern retreat at the heart of Heliopolis, Unwind in a spacious, open-plan living room. This apartment offers both convenience and comfort.","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis stylish and comfortable apartment is designed for both short and extended stays.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find:\r\n✔️one bedrooms with a king-size bed.\r\n✔️A full bathroom stocked with fresh face and body towels .\r\n✔️A spacious open-plan living room with exotic touches.\r\n✔️A dining area for enjoying meals together.\r\n✔️A kitchenette equipped with a Nespresso machine, kettle, hot plate, microwave, and cooking utensils.\r\n✔️A 65-inch Smart TV with cable and streaming access.\r\n✔️Reliable Wi-Fi for work or entertainment.\r\n✔️Complimentary bottled water, and two coffee capsules.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nYou’ll have the entire place to yourself—no shared spaces, just your own slice of serenity.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\n✔️We’re available to assist you between 9:00 AM and 4:00 AM Cairo time.\r\n✔️Whether you have questions before arrival or need help during your stay, our team is happy to support you on via Airbnb messages throughout your experience.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n✔️Cairo International Airport is a 10 min drive.\r\n✔️Giza Pyramids is a 50 min drive\r\n✔️Downtown Cairo is a 30 min drive \r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Private Services: We offer convenient airport pickup, drop-off, and private guided tours across Cairo and Giza. Just message us to arrange in advance.\r\n✔️ Free of charge parking is available. \r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Smoking is only allowed outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors).\r\n✔️ Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n✔️ All guests must provide a valid ID for registration with the building manager before or upon check-in.\r\n✔️ You may be asked to show identification to access certain facilities in the building.\r\n✔️ Free of charge parking is available. "},"city":"Cairo","capacity_of_guests":2,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":2,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"2 Salah Magdy St. from Abdallah Deraz Al Golf","location_address2":"","location_lat":"30.0838105","location_lng":"31.3353108","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":20,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":493471,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 100 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. (In case of disapproval from community security office, guests will be fully refunded).\r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancellation between 15 days and 30 days before the arrival date, 